      <package fileName="SmartCrop-1.0.4-20261008.zip" sha1="a9e6ed1a4d3d9945eeff359352ce29c6e6826b20" type="script" releaseDate="20261008">
         <title>SmartCrop 1.0.4</title>
         <description>
            <p>Readable preview (stretched image, unusable area in red, crop outline in yellow; closed on Crop); asks before re-cropping already cropped images; edges no longer erode on repeated runs.</p>
            <p>After installation the script is available as Script &gt; Utilities &gt; SmartCrop.</p>
         </description>
